        "question_type": "single_choice",
        "question_title": "The system \\(\\sin x+\\sin y=1\\) and \\(\\cos x+\\cos y=\\sqrt{3}\\), where \\(x,y\\in[0,2\\pi)\\), has how many ordered pairs \\((x,y)\\)?",
